    <tag k="inscription" v="Usred ste Srbije, a ostali ste bez novca? Ne brinite, to je uobičajena situacija za većinu ljudi ovde. / In the middle of Serbia, and run out of money? Don't worry, it is a usual situation for most people here."/>
    <tag k="inscription:en:1" v="On a scale of 1-10, with 10 being as much fun as a human can handle, riding the bicycle is, for me, probably an 8 or 9. A 10 would require my boyfriend's direct involvement (wink-wink). (unknown girl on a bike)"/>
    <tag k="inscription:sr:1" v="Na skali od 1 do 10, gde 10 predstavlja najveći provod koji ljudsko biće može da doživi, vožnja bicikla je za mene između 8 i 9. Za desetku je već potrebno direktno angažovanje mog dečka (namig, namig). (anonimna biciklistkinja)"/>
    <tag k="ref" v="1510"/>
    <tag k="tourism" v="information"/>
    <tag k="wikimedia_commons" v="File:Cycling_guidepost_Serbia_Eurovelo_6_-_ref_1510.jpg"/>
  </node>
